---
source: src/ui.rs
expression: draw(&app)
---
" gitenv  right identity, right repo                                                             "
"┌ Profiles ───┌ Help (any key to close) ─────────────────────────────────────────┐─────────────┐"
"│  ● personal │↑ ↓  j k  move between profiles                                   │             │"
"│> ◆ acme  ada│Enter     apply the selected profile to this repo                 │             │"
"│             │u         undo the last apply or fix                              │             │"
"│             │e         edit the selected profile                               │             │"
"│             │n         create a new profile                                    │             │"
"│             │N         create a profile from this repo's identity and remote   │             │"
"│             │d         delete the selected profile                             │             │"
"│             │r         re-read the repo and the profiles file                  │             │"
"│             │f         re-author unpushed commits made as someone else         │             │"
"│             │/         filter the list; Enter keeps it, Esc clears it          │             │"
"│             │D         check the selected profile's keys and logins            │             │"
"│             │H         install the hooks that check every commit               │             │"
"│             │I         let git apply your rules by itself                      │             │"
"│             │w         why this repo belongs to the profile it does            │             │"
"│             │c         clone a repository onto the right profile               │             │"
"│             │R         your commits by profile, this month and others          │me.example:  │"
"│        _ _  │s         list every repository next to this one, or go back to it│             │"
"│   __ _(_) |_│?  h      show this help                                          │             │"
"│  / _` | | __│q  Esc    quit                                                    │             │"
"│ | (_| | | |_│                                                                  │             │"
"│  \__, |_|\__│● marks the profile git is using here; ◆ marks the one            │             │"
"│  |___/      │whose remote or path rules claim this repo.                       │             │"
"└─────────────└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘─────────────┘"
" ↑↓/jk select   Enter apply to repo   e edit   n new   d delete   f authors   ? help   q quit   "
